OL,3,GNEWSAUK and Jersey police assisting
OL,4,Amurder inquiry
OL,5,
OL,6,FPolice investigating the suspected
OL,7,Fmurder of a woman in Alderney are
OL,8,Freceiving assistance from officers in
OL,9,FJersey and the UK.
OL,11,FHannah Benfield, 34, was found in the
OL,12,Fsea at the base of cliffs in the west
OL,13,Fof the island on Monday and a
OL,14,F44-year-old man has been arrested on
OL,15,Fsuspicion of her murder.
OL,23,APub: 01-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Ch Is NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,443,440,260,160,0,100
