OL,3,GNEWSAUK and Jersey police assisting
OL,4,Amurder inquiry
OL,5,
OL,6,FStates of Jersey Police said it had
OL,7,Fdeployed five specialist search
OL,8,Fofficers to Alderney following a
OL,9,F"standard mutual aid" request, while
OL,10,Fother officers are assisting from the
OL,11,Fsouth-west of the UK and Guernsey
OL,12,FCustoms and Immigration, said Guernsey
OL,13,FPolice.
OL,15,FChief officer Damian Kitchen said the
OL,16,Finvestigation had been a "complex"
OL,17,Fprocess requiring "meticulous work".
